card.text:
When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control. Megadomain — Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each land subtype among lands you control. Equip {4}
---
Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. (Then shuffle this card into its owner's library.)

When this Equipment enters, mill three cards. You may put a land card from among them into your hand. When you don't, attach this Equipment to target creature you control.
Equipped creature has "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this Equipment: This creature deals 2 damage to any target."
Equip {1}

When you cycle this card and whenever this creature deals damage to a noncreature, create a Blood token, you lose 1 life, and you draw a card at the beginning of the next opponent's turn's upkeep.
Ward—Pay 5 life or pay {5}.
Basic landcycling {1}{UB}

When this Equipment enters, put two petrify counters on up to one target tapped creature. (Petrified creature costs {1} more to untap. A permanent with petrify counters equal or more than its power is a noncreature artifact.)
Equipped creature has "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this Equipment: This creature deals 2 damage to any target."
Equip {1}

Equipped creature has designer deathtouch. (Whenever equipped creature would deal damage to a nontoken permanent, If that permanents designer has been noted, treat that damage as deathtouch damage. Otherwise note that designer.)
Whenever equipped creature deals damage, create a Food token.
Equip {2}

Enchant creature
The creature this permanent is attached to gets +1/+1 for each artifact and/or enchantment you control. (An aura not attached is put into its owners graveyard.)
Equip {3}
